plan.prompt:
Application to build:
{{input.request}}

Project directory: {{input.projectDir}}
Test command: {{input.testCommand}}

Produce: requirements, architecture, the list of files/modules, and an ordered implementation plan with acceptance criteria. Do not write code.

implement.prompt:
Request:
{{input.request}}

Project directory: {{input.projectDir}}

Plan:
{{steps.plan}}

Implement the application: create and edit the files, add unit tests. Reply with a short summary of what was done.

review.prompt:
Plan:
{{steps.plan}}

Implementation summary:
{{steps.implement}}

Review the code in {{input.projectDir}} against the plan: correctness, missing parts, security, readability. Reply with only a JSON object: {"approved": true or false, "issues": ["..."]}. approved is true only when nothing must change; issues lists every finding (empty when approved).

rework.prompt:
Plan:
{{steps.plan}}

Review findings:
{{steps.review.issues}}

Fix every finding in the project files in {{input.projectDir}}. Reply with a short summary of the changes.

test.prompt:
Plan:
{{steps.plan}}

Add the tests that are missing for the acceptance criteria in {{input.projectDir}}. The tests are run afterwards with: {{input.testCommand}}
Reply with a short summary of the tests added.

fixtests.prompt:
The command `{{steps.runtests.command}}` in {{input.projectDir}} ended with exit code {{steps.runtests.exitCode}} (timed out: {{steps.runtests.timedOut}}). Last lines of its output:
{{steps.runtests.tail}}

Fix the cause of every failure in the project files. Reply with a short summary.
